Z||000027||BN Boomer||04-27-2000||06:47 PM||||<I>Who really, honestly, needs and wants a cup holder anyway, soccer moms/dads?</I><P>Hey, how about us commuters who drive more than 3 blocks to work? I often like to enjoy some sort of beverage, even if it's only a bottle of Rail Ale, on my daily 36 mile journey to work and it would be nice if it didn't have to always reside between my legs. Or would you really rather have me weaving in and out of heavy traffic "driving that thing for all she's worth" on my way to work? <P>I'd further say if one is really into the "driving experience", then they shouldn't have other unnecessary conveniences such as a stereo, A/C, PW, PL, PM, CC, sunroof, cigarette ligher, ashtrays, etc, etc, either. <P>Hey, if GM can put cup holders into an SD70MAC then they could have put one in my freakin' Fiero. ||||reg||6
Z||000028||Gold-86SE||04-27-2000||09:34 PM||||<BR>IMHO<P>means - in my humble opinion||||reg||4
